**Falsifier:** The claim is falsified if the census finds any `AF-*` token in one of the four canonical artifacts that (a) is not a declared class id, (b) is not resolvable to a registered (parent_class, variant_id) or a registered delta-file reference, and (c) appears in a class-assertion position (`class_id`/`class_ids`/`conclusion_type`/`regularity`/`regularity_token`/`family`/`declared_selector`, or a `key: value` line with those keys) — OR if a delta file cited as evidence is missing/empty, OR if re-running `class_separation.regression()` shows FN>0 or FP>0, OR if any declared-class token appears in a `class_ids` field alongside a variant token.

